          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-volume-based-quoting-on-site.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Route planning in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Auto Territory Creation by ZIP & City",
        text: "Build canvassing and targeted marketing territories automatically from ZIP codes and cities. Target neighborhoods undergoing heavy renovation, spring decluttering, or high real estate turnover to dominate local cleanouts.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-photo-annotation-for-the-pile.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Territory management in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Smarter Truck Route Planning",
        text: "Optimize daily schedules for crews running 5 to 8 cleanout stops a day. Cluster neighborhood pickups to minimize drive time between properties and keep trucks arriving within promised two-hour customer arrival windows.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-job-tagging-by-type-1.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Field activity log in Knockio",
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    label: "Work Orders & Dump Costing",
    cards: [
      {
        title: "Junk Work Orders & Item Checklists",
        text: "Build detailed work orders specifying furniture, heavy appliances, e-waste, or yard debris. Hauling crews view itemized removal lists and customer loading instructions directly on their mobile app before starting work.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-route-planning-for-same-day-hauls.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Job management in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Transfer-Station Weight-Ticket Costing",
        text: "Stop guessing your job profitability. Hauling crews snap photos of transfer-station scale tickets and log dumping fees directly against the job record, giving you exact job-costing and net profit per truckload.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-live-gps-tracking-with-proximity-intelligence.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Crew dispatching in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Truck Space & Fleet Utilization",
        text: "Track remaining cubic-yard truck capacity across your fleet in real time. Know which truck has room for a quarter-load pickup before dispatching them across town.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-automated-territory-creation-by-zip-code-and-city.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Work orders in Knockio",
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    label: "Documents & Compliance",
    cards: [
      {
        title: "Prohibited Hazmat Inspection & Indemnification",
        text: "Before loading starts, require homeowners to sign a digital Prohibited-Items Indemnification—confirming the load contains no wet paint, biohazards, asbestos, chemicals, or pressurized tanks.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-centralized-file-storage-per-job.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Smart estimates in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Light Demolition Hold-Harmless Waivers",
        text: "When tearing down decks, sheds, hot tubs, or above-ground pools, require customers to execute a specialized Light Demolition Structural Hold-Harmless Waiver on site to protect your company against property damage claims.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-job-notes-and-surveys-on-site-with-e-signatures.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Proposals in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Before & After Hauling Photo Proof",
        text: "Hauling crews capture timestamped before-and-after photos of cluttered spaces and swept-clean garages or yards—automatically attaching visual proof to the job record to prevent client disputes.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-job-notes-and-surveys-on-site.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Digital contracts in Knockio",
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    label: "Quote & Get Paid",
    cards: [
      {
        title: "On-Site Firm Volume-Based Quoting",
        text: "Estimate jobs the way junk hauling actually works: on arrival, based on visual truck volume. Quote firm, all-inclusive prices from minimum loads to full trucks on a tablet and capture instant customer e-signature approval.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-flexible-payment-collection.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Video and file storage in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "E-Contracts With Clear Hauling Terms",
        text: "Send commercial service agreements and residential cleanout contracts for digital signature with IP timestamp logging. Keep all signed hold-harmless and hazmat waivers permanently archived in the job file.",
        image: asset(
          "inner-junk-removal-software-and-crm-milestone-billing-for-large-cleanouts.webp",
        ),
        alt: "Photo uploads in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Collect on Site",
        text: "Collect payment immediately upon job completion before the truck drives away. Process credit cards, debit cards, Text-to-Pay, or ACH on site to eliminate billing delays.",
